From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 03:25:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Standardise emoji sizing across status controls

- Use `--emoji-size` for inline and reaction emojis
- Allow poll emojis to retain their natural aspect ratio
- Add minimum sizing without forcing image widths

Rationale: Centralising emoji dimensions improves visual consistency while preventing distortion of rectangular custom emoji assets.

diff --git a/app/javascript/styles/mastodon/components.scss b/app/javascript/styles/mastodon/components.scss
index d583b729be..fef7b1e440 100644
--- a/app/javascript/styles/mastodon/components.scss
+++ b/app/javascript/styles/mastodon/components.scss
@@ -2142,8 +2142,8 @@
     background: var(--background-color);
 
     .emojione {
-      width: 18px;
-      height: 18px;
+      --emoji-size: 18px;
+
       margin: 0;
     }
   }
@@ -2666,8 +2666,8 @@ a.account__display-name {
     flex: 0 0 auto;
 
     .emojione {
-      width: 18px;
-      height: 18px;
+      --emoji-size: 18px;
+
       margin: 0;
     }
   }
@@ -9139,15 +9139,17 @@ noscript {
     transition-property: background-color, color;
 
     &__emoji {
+      --emoji-size: 16px;
+
       display: block;
       margin: 3px 0;
-      width: 16px;
-      height: 16px;
+      width: auto;
+      min-width: var(--emoji-size);
+      height: var(--emoji-size);
 
       img {
         display: block;
         margin: 0;
-        width: 100%;
         height: 100%;
         min-width: auto;
         min-height: auto;
@@ -11178,8 +11180,8 @@ noscript {
   }
 
   &__reaction .emojione {
-    width: 22px;
-    height: 22px;
+    --emoji-size: 22px;
+
     margin: 0;
   }
 
